# ---- uv ----
# uv.lock is intentionally NOT ignored: commit it for reproducible installs if
# you adopt `uv sync`. The requirements.txt workflow does not generate one.
# uv's package cache lives outside the project (~/.cache/uv), nothing to ignore.

